  "id": "section-943",
  "title": "关于建造主席塑像问题的指示",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-323.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>323)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n林彪、恩来及文革小组各同志：<br>\n<br>\n　　此类事是劳民伤财，无利有害，如不制止，势必会刮起一阵浮夸风。碰头会讨论一下，发一指示，加以制止。<br><br>\n<p>　　毛泽东<br><br>\n　　七月五日</p>\n<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-322.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-324.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
}
